{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》11月20日劇情迎來震撼反轉，夏無雙與李德龍驚覺海旁遺留鞋碼與死者關子盈完全不符。林安安企圖以DM28接客影片勒索卻慘遭毒打撞車昏迷，連串暴力事件勢將隱瞞7年命案真相徹底撕裂。關鍵證據USB最終落入夏無雙手中掀起更恐怖殺機。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹握DM28影片勒索惹禍遇襲重傷昏迷</h2>\n<p>劇情高潮落在林安安身上，她向黎綺雲爆出自己手握關子盈當年於DM28接客絕密影片。黎綺雲隨即派人前往林安安家中強行交收USB，未料林安安臨場反口要求加碼，最終觸怒幕後黑手遭到殘酷毒打。她逃走期間更慘被車輛猛烈撞擊至重傷昏迷，雖然關鍵影片最終輾轉落入夏無雙手中，但目擊震撼畫面的她已斷言這場意外絕對是藍鳳儀親手策劃。</p>\n<h2>天誠娛樂老闆生哥下達封口令強行掩蓋真相</h2>\n<p>面對局勢逐漸失控邊緣，高層生哥立刻採取強硬手段介入事件。他親自尋找黎綺雲出面擺平危機，並嚴厲下令全體人員由現在開始嚴禁任何人再次提及DM28以及關子盈名字。生哥試圖以極權方式將這樁隱瞞7年命案強行壓低，務求令所有知情人士徹底收聲，這種高壓處理手法反而令夏無雙更加確信娛樂圈背後隱藏極度龐大黑暗勢力。</p>\n<h2>馬國明楊茜堯察覺海旁鞋碼不符揭發偽造遺書</h2>\n<p>李德龍與夏無雙聯手追查關子盈死亡謎團期間發現極大破綻，證實當日海旁遺留鞋子與死者本身鞋碼完全不脗合。二人順藤摸瓜揭發藍鳳儀當年曾將DM28不雅影片發送給關子盈作威脅，更利用對方手機發送偽造遺書。藍鳳儀精心刪除所有通訊紀錄後再將手機棄置落海，這段被掩埋7年恩怨情仇如今全數曝光，促使男女主角決心查明真相。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚劇情反轉高呼娛樂圈復仇戲碼極震撼</h2>\n<p>劇集播出後網上討論區掀起極大熱議，大批觀眾對緊湊劇情發展感到無比震撼。有網民留言表示「鄺潔楹被車撞嗰幕睇到心寒」、「楊茜堯同馬國明查案真係好有火花」，認為劇集成功營造出娛樂圈爾虞我詐壓迫感。亦有觀眾直指偽造自殺情節令人心寒，紛紛留言「姚子羚做反派真係好入戲」、「期待真相大白嗰刻」，高度評價劇組編排心機。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500819117033960_3476782476afda6bf891e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500819117033960_3476782476afda6bf891e0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950081926287068_8431312716afda6c17d5d8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950081926287068_8431312716afda6c17d5d8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500819474497178_6530655956afda6c32e12b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500819474497178_6530655956afda6c32e12b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500819612484897_10452125936afda6c4818fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500819612484897_10452125936afda6c4818fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950081977059078_14596029666afda6c64733c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950081977059078_14596029666afda6c64733c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500820773761742_16953621166afda6d04a517.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500820773761742_16953621166afda6d04a517.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500822739946909_18474128106afda6e422fe6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500822739946909_18474128106afda6e422fe6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500823498081280_4847874576afda6eb56d3a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500823498081280_4847874576afda6eb56d3a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500824402494950_7928712466afda6f48c63c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500824402494950_7928712466afda6f48c63c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500825105971289_14503919376afda6fb8adc9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179500825105971289_14503919376afda6fb8adc9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:44:04.899145+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1143,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:24:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:57:28.939101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:25.728114+00:00","content_hash":"6391138cda0d47c45a8510538e2854be316d6f69dd06da5b5a1221929bcf81bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}